<%# nav-count.ejs
     The watch tally on the sidebar tab.

     It sits in the shell, so like the topbar readouts it stops being
     re-derived once navigation only replaces <main>. Deleting your last
     watch emptied the list, emptied the chips, and left the sidebar
     insisting you still had one. %>
<span class="n" id="navWatchCount"<%- oob ? ' hx-swap-oob="true"' : '' %>><%= watchCount %></span>
